# The Davoi Report (San d'Oria 2-2, mission.sandoria.the_davoi_report). A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with 1-1
# completed (a GM; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Section 1 (no current mission, a San d'Orian): Endracion's
# script plays 1009; its finish with option 1 does nothing; again, with option 104: begun. Section 2 (2-2 current):
# Endracion at status 0 plays ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44. Davoi: Zantaviat at status 0: 100, whose finish sets
# status 1; Zantaviat at status 1 with no Lost Document: his script's 101. The first, second and third "!" (x
# 294, 335 and 163: not between 210 and 212): Davoi's YOU_SEE_NOTHING, 7433 (from DefaultActions: "!" has no NPC
# script); the fourth (x 211.2): the Lost Document and status 2; the fourth again (the document held): 7433 again.
# Zantaviat with the document: 104, whose finish sets status 3, takes the document and gives the Temple Knights Davoi
# Report. Endracion at status 3, not completed: 1028 with the arguments 0, 0, 0, 44 (no handler finishes it). Northern
# San d'Oria's Papal Chambers door: not completed, the report held: 695, whose finish completes the mission (350 rank
# points) and takes the report. The mission current again (a GM), status 3 and the report: Papal Chambers door
# (completed): ITS_LOCKED, 11558; Endracion (completed): 1006, whose finish completes it again. Rival zone-in, another
# mission's script: the warp to Northern San d'Oria plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn, which
# returns 878 (no event packet), and area 12's status goes from 0 to 1.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1006 Davoi/Zantaviat/onTrigger Davoi/!/onTrigger Davoi/onEventFinish/100 Davoi/onEventFinish/104 NorthernSanDoria/_6fc/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/695
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
login
trigger Endracion                       # section 1: his script's 1009
finish option=1                         # not 104: nothing
trigger Endracion                       # 1009 again
finish option=104                       # 104: begun
trigger Endracion                       # section 2, status 0: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44
warp 215,0.1,-10 Davoi
trigger Zantaviat                       # status 0: 100
finish                                  # status 1
trigger Zantaviat                       # status 1, no document: his script's 101
finish-if-event
trigger !                               # x 294: out of 210..212: YOU_SEE_NOTHING 7433
trigger !+1                             # x 335: 7433
trigger !+2                             # x 163: 7433
trigger !+3                             # x 211.2: the Lost Document, status 2
finish-if-event
trigger !+3                             # the document held: 7433
trigger Zantaviat                       # the document held: 104
finish                                  # status 3, the document taken, the Davoi Report given
warp -108.5,1,-34 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Endracion                       # status 3, not completed: 1028
finish
warp 131,-11,122 NorthernSanDoria
trigger _6fc                            # not completed, the report held: 695
finish                                  # completed (350 rank points), the report taken
mission Sandoria TheDavoiReport current # a GM
missionstatus Sandoria 3
keyitem TempleKnightsDavoiReport
trigger _6fc                            # completed: ITS_LOCKED 11558
finish-if-event
warp -108.5,1,-34 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Endracion                       # status 3, completed: 1006
finish                                  # completed again, the report taken
